  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "seg-0001",
      "index": 0,
      "startMs": 300,
      "endMs": 5370,
      "text": "哎雪玲，你最近在忙啥？好久没见你发朋友圈了。",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0002",
      "index": 1,
      "startMs": 5820,
      "endMs": 10874,
      "text": "我开了个 Substack！专门写华语和台湾音乐的中文翻译。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0003",
      "index": 2,
      "startMs": 11324,
      "endMs": 14810,
      "text": "哇，有点东西啊。怎么突然想搞这个？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0004",
      "index": 3,
      "startMs": 15260,
      "endMs": 26692,
      "text": "就是想在下班之后，做点原创的、有意义的东西。我这个人吧，就是活到老学到老，特别喜欢学习新东西，也想认真写作和研究。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0005",
      "index": 4,
      "startMs": 27142,
      "endMs": 29270,
      "text": "懂。那你平时都写啥？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0006",
      "index": 5,
      "startMs": 29720,
      "endMs": 38539,
      "text": "主要是关于华语和台湾音乐的翻译，还有我个人的一些思考。我会聊中国和日本的哲学、灵性、美学之类的。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0007",
      "index": 6,
      "startMs": 38989,
      "endMs": 42998,
      "text": "听起来很文艺啊。你之前不是学写小说的吗？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0008",
      "index": 7,
      "startMs": 43448,
      "endMs": 51135,
      "text": "对啊，我更习惯当个 creative writer，写 essay 或者 journalism 还在摸索中。但我在努力！",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0009",
      "index": 8,
      "startMs": 51585,
      "endMs": 55074,
      "text": "那你这个 blog 有定位吗？比如走什么 niche？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0010",
      "index": 9,
      "startMs": 55524,
      "endMs": 63603,
      "text": "说实话，我不太想刻意搞什么 niche。就顺其自然，围绕东亚研究这个主题。走着瞧呗！",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0011",
      "index": 10,
      "startMs": 64053,
      "endMs": 68054,
      "text": "哈哈，松弛感拉满。那你平时喜欢啥？",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0012",
      "index": 11,
      "startMs": 68504,
      "endMs": 74214,
      "text": "山、茶、独处。我跟道家隐士、和尚、古代诗人有种深深的共鸣。",
      "speaker": "B",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    },
    {
      "id": "seg-0013",
      "index": 12,
      "startMs": 74664,
      "endMs": 78526,
      "text": "绝了，听起来很适合你。那我蹲一个订阅！",
      "speaker": "A",
      "confidence": null,
      "tokens": null
    }
  ],
